---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="ASTERWARD publishes twice-daily market intelligence for the United States, Taiwan, and Malaysia, constrained by evidence and explicit invalidation conditions."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/about/"
>
  <section class="site-shell archive-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>ASTERWARD</h1>
    <p>
      ASTERWARD publishes twice-daily intelligence for the United States,
      Taiwan, and Malaysia, turning fundamentals, technicals, and positioning into testable market outlooks.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="article-grid">
    <div class="article-body">
      <p>
        Each brief carries one primary thesis, no more than two secondary signals,
        and explicit confirmation and invalidation conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>Primary markets</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>United States</li>
        <li>Taiwan</li>
        <li>Malaysia</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Daily workflow</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Morning: previous US session, Taiwan fundamentals and positioning, plus Taiwan and US pre-market outlooks</li>
        <li>Evening: Taiwan and Malaysia closes, plus the US pre-market session outlook</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Research philosophy</h2>
      <blockquote>
        Fact → Pricing → Outlook → Verification
      </blockquote>

      <p>Independent research and market commentary. Not investment advice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
